      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors recommend a postoperative administration of the mixture consisting of phentanil, droperidol and dimedrol. The mixture would provide anesthesia during 4-10 hours and a peaceful sleep during 2-4 hours. In case of necessity the mixture may be reinjected."},
